@startuml
title TelcoGuard — Core Class Diagram

class StreamlitApp {
  +load_model()
  +predict(input)
  +render_dashboard()
}

class FeatureEngineering {
  +load_data()
  +create_features()
  +save_engineered()
}

class Trainer {
  +train()
  +evaluate()
  +save_model()
}

class GenAIService {
  +analyze_customer()
  +generate_action_plan()
}

class AzureMLOps {
  +register_model()
  +deploy()
  +monitor()
}

StreamlitApp --> Trainer : uses
StreamlitApp --> GenAIService : uses
Trainer --> FeatureEngineering : uses
Trainer --> AzureMLOps : registers
GenAIService --> AzureMLOps : fetch model

@enduml